notes:
  - Tax is applied: Thailand 2026 personal income tax, from the Scenario's Levy "th-2026-pit".
  - Tax before 2026 is not recomputed; any tax still owed belongs in the Ledger as a liability.
  - The tax year 2025-01-01 to 2025-12-31 is left out: it ended before the As-of 2026-01-01, so nothing can be added to it.
  - These figures are what this plan's own tax rules would charge, an estimate and not tax advice. Each fund has holding rules of its own to check before buying.

