Assumptions (tax figures used whose source is not yet confirmed):
- allowances.retirementCluster.combinedCeiling = 500000 (reported): Retirement allowances combined ceiling, baht.
- allowances.retirementCluster.rmf.ceiling = 500000 (reported): RMF ceiling, baht a year.
- allowances.retirementCluster.rmf.maxRate = 0.3 (reported): RMF limit, share of assessable income.
- allowances.thaiEsg.ceiling = 300000 (reported): ThaiESG ceiling, baht a year.
- allowances.thaiEsg.maxRate = 0.3 (reported): ThaiESG limit, share of assessable income.
